<%- include('partials/header',{title}) %><section class="assistant-layout"><div class="assistant-main panel"><div class="assistant-heading"><div class="assistant-avatar">✦</div><div><h3>WellSpring Health Guide</h3><p><span class="online-dot"></span> Health education & well-being support</p></div><span class="tag">Gemma assistant</span></div><div class="safety-note"><strong>Important:</strong> I'm not a doctor and can't diagnose conditions, prescribe medication or replace professional care. For emergencies, contact local emergency services now.</div><div id="chatMessages" class="chat-messages"><div class="chat-bubble assistant-bubble"><strong>Hello, <%= currentUser.name.split(' ')[0] %>.</strong><p>I'm here to help with general health information and personal well-being. What's on your mind today?</p><small>Gemma · Not a medical professional</small></div><% messages.forEach(m=>{ %><div class="chat-bubble <%= m.role==='user'?'user-bubble':'assistant-bubble' %>"><p><%= m.message %></p><small><%= m.mode==='gemma'?'Gemma · Verify important health information with a professional':m.mode==='safety'?'Safety guidance':'Saved conversation' %></small></div><% }) %></div><div class="suggested-prompts"><button type="button" data-prompt="What are some healthy ways to manage everyday stress?">Managing stress</button><button type="button" data-prompt="How can I build a more consistent sleep routine?">Better sleep</button><button type="button" data-prompt="How can I prepare for a conversation with a healthcare professional?">Prepare for a visit</button></div><form id="chatForm" class="chat-input"><textarea id="chatInput" rows="1" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Ask a general health or well-being question…" required></textarea><button class="send-btn" aria-label="Send message">➤</button></form><div id="chatStatus" class="chat-status" aria-live="polite">Don't include identifying details. Personal history is used only if enabled in Personalization & data.</div></div><aside class="assistant-side"><div class="panel"><h3>What I can help with</h3><ul class="help-list"><li>Understand general health topics</li><li>Explore healthy routines</li><li>Prepare questions for a clinician</li><li>Reflect on well-being patterns</li></ul><p><a href="/profile" class="text-link">Manage personalization →</a></p></div><div class="panel emergency-panel"><span class="emergency-icon">!</span><h3>Need urgent help?</h3><p>If you have severe chest pain, serious difficulty breathing, signs of stroke, severe bleeding, loss of consciousness, or immediate risk of harm, seek emergency help now. Don't wait for a chatbot response.</p></div></aside></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>
